8. The disease progresses rapidly, for example, the lymph nodes increase by more than 50% within 2 months, and/or peripheral blood lymphocytes absolute value doubling time \ 3 times the upper limit of normal value, aspartate aminotransferase (AST)\> 3 times the upper limit of normal value, total bilirubin (TBIL)\> upper limit of normal value 2 Times, serum creatinine clearance rate \<30ml/min;
