5. Before treatment, the total bilirubin (TBIL) of the patient was less than 1.5 times the upper limit of normal value (ULN), alanine aminotransferase (ALT) and aspartate aminotransferase (AST) were less than 3 times the ULN, and serum creatinine was less than 1.5 times the ULN.
